        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>80 Inch Offset Security Bar</b>\r\n<p>\r\n80\" Offset Security Plates are for use on single outswing wood or metal doors to cover the gap between the door and jamb. Protects the <b>full door height (80\")</b>, effectively preventing prying and manipulation of the door. Great for side and rear exit doors, specially doors equipped with <a href=\"/collections/panic-devices\"><b>Panic Devices</b></a>. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-E11SBR_size.gif?v=1704442274\" height=\"425\" width=\"400\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Pemko 3572SP Door Security Bar\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nExcellent for school classroom door opening onto exterior walkways and are specified and approved by major school districts for this purpose. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nMade from 10 gauge galvanized steel for strength and durability. The very fine matte finish acts like a primer allowing paint to adhere easily and is very rust proof. Includes thru-bolts for mounting.\r\n</p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for  Offset Security Bar\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length:  80\" </li>\r\n<li>Width: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 1/8\" (0.137)</li>\r\n<li>Offset: 3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Supplied drilled 12\" on center with 1/4\" holes</li>\r\n<li>Includes thru-bolts for mounting</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p><b>*Sold Individually</b>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "80 Inch Offset Security Bar, NGP 1392SP-80",
